{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "81e9af14b1eeaea47b5bbd60964817a9fc2cf572e98819b52e3d03eaebfdc4d0", "ja": "（今日は、映画『三姉妹カフェ』の撮影。\nリハーサルが終わり、休憩時間だが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄电影《三姊妹咖啡厅》。\n目前已结束排练，进入休息时间，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "5015d738c55492959f67797ebc2d73094c938a8275f71bdbdff5634b025525fa", "ja": "「それにしても、どうして三奈にだけ……」\nやっぱり、もう少し自然なほうがいいかな……。", "zh": "「话说回来，为什么只有三奈……」\n果然还是自然一点比较好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "168aaf327fcec49223d2fe88325ea17ed35e466e0d09f0920bc270a9156ee23b", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保。休憩時間まで練習なんて、\nずいぶん気合いが入ってるんだな！", "zh": "辛苦了，志保。\n连休息时间都在练习，看来你干劲十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "e0de734f382acc3e35acd8398b2cadbae0fab1bf0b69d03a95417db33ab5076d", "ja": "お疲れさまです。{$P$}さん。\n……お仕事ですから、当然だと思いますけど。", "zh": "你也辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n……毕竟是工作，我认为这是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "f19720eaf73a8738c5a3de7ead5c6dbbd3b49f145f4892c5048274a7cd9cfeff", "ja": "せっかくいただいた役ですし。美也さんに負けない\nぐらい、いいお芝居をしたいと思うのは当然です。", "zh": "而且我好不容易才拿到这个角色，\n当然会想演好，不输给美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "094d2e0f01474e20cd17037dbe95a36911bd76acabacae985fc14744233ce6ea", "ja": "それより、時間があるなら台本の読み合わせを手伝って\nもらえませんか？　もう一度、確認しておきたくて。", "zh": "对了，如果你有空，可以陪我对台词吗？\n我想再确认一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "10ab10b642fc72d7240b4b67652108e34a61cd644a6ced29d268ac0244dd71fa", "ja": "もちろん！\n俺でよければ、いくらでも相手になるよ。", "zh": "当然可以！\n只要你不嫌弃，不管几次我都会陪你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "fef2b1f921029e6abc395714919df5c4f9ac411689f1d989eca8a83040552cc2", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれでは……んんっ、こほん。", "zh": "谢谢。\n那就开始吧……嗯嗯，咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "315b3cd11df17765c6ed3e371ff8e0f443dbbb48c0d859db997090ce7d731f5a", "ja": "「それにしても、どうして三奈にだけ、\n私達ネコの言葉がわかるのかしら？」", "zh": "「话说回来，\n为什么只有三奈听得懂我们猫的语言呢？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e189e3df5d97971f1e20f5a50ad1af84bf28ce7ab3b099412b8d9278ee4a1a2e", "ja": "ええと……「不思議ですね～。\nでも、お話ができて、とっても楽しいですよ～」", "zh": "呃……「很不可思议吧～\n不过，可以和她聊天，我觉得很开心～」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1010_p", "source_sha256": "56e417bae6d33b8afd023c5d1de9c5e98f9b5701b466591cbf6c39e0f88eff75", "ja": "「本当は一夏さんや二葉ちゃんとも、\nお話ができたらいいんですけど～」", "zh": "「我其实也希望能跟一夏和二叶交谈啦～」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "e9f409ebf1a8ff91531c6c5f4944481b3fcf275a59717fa2dd8440336b7bead5", "ja": "「……まあ、その方が便利だけど……\n私は今のままでいいわ」", "zh": "「……嗯，那样会比较方便……\n但我觉得维持现状就好了。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "b6e1135ef7e963d2eb724024ae9fbcf8274859c3d72e176eb6442f43dbc245b9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。\n……うん。今の感じでいけば、大丈夫かな。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你。\n……唔，照刚才的感觉去演可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fbdf65826d6ece2f383257db6fefbc3fd89aaaf6ea9ed125d28343c5307bc024", "ja": "うん、なかなか良かったと思うよ。一匹狼の\nネコっぽくて……いや、ネコだから狼じゃないのか？", "zh": "嗯，我认为很棒喔，很像孤傲的一匹狼……\n不对，牠是猫，所以不能说是狼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "a22b3871486e05b49a9276d29ad85503a4b828c8cc30af59ecd20feaeca3dc0d", "ja": "シッポは野良なので、一匹狼感はあったほうが\nいいと思います。けど……ふふっ。", "zh": "因为志尾是野猫，我觉得有孤傲的感觉比较好，\n不过……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8cf07b6e0e607e41b0caf516c948232b2aeb99b9216f4948aa49843e2c2f7ff6", "ja": "志保？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "志保？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "a3dab0026a58a98053ea29e5aa36d998a3790ae6ae7ec31f07fbd0da0c8e6f38", "ja": "いえ。{$P$}さんが美也さんの\nマネをしていたのが、ちょっと……かわいいなって。", "zh": "没事，{$P$}先生模仿美也的样子……\n我觉得有点可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1017_p", "source_sha256": "42d3009c8022e131496be2d12e2818aa7c733d5e92a8f705c6aefb96d74e09c8", "ja": "それを言うなら、志保の方がかわいかったと思うけど。\nその衣装も、よく似合ってるしな。", "zh": "真要说可爱，也是你比较可爱吧？\n而且你很适合那套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "357e1ed466d524a1a359fe1dee386cf3d082064eb637e1b0b7ca352a63edcd74", "ja": "えっ！？　……あ、衣装……\nそう、ですか。……。", "zh": "咦！？……啊，服装……\n这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "9428180c1ff4d52c743885fc3c0fa1196302df0c7fe547e9780b2b451a3382e7", "ja": "あの。そろそろ撮影が始まるので、\n私、向こうに行きますね。失礼します。", "zh": "那个，差不多要开始录影了，\n我过去啰，失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a6d48bc037f9ba117e65825bc0ec140eebaf388cbb019444ab6a2bac5345c7cb", "ja": "（映画での志保と美也の掛け合いは、ネコらしく\nとても可愛いと評判になった……よかったな、志保！）", "zh": "（电影中志保与美也的互动大受好评，\n大家都说很像猫咪，相当可爱……太好了，志保！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
